{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game through your input</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the unknown and experience the infinite</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you can input anything to play the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567920/extras/938babf159204ad6ffd63979f6b13fea.avif?t=1745576247\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567920/extras_big/938babf159204ad6ffd63979f6b13fea.avif?t=1745576247 width=800 height=442 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a groundbreaking AI-driven text adventure game, it combines dynamic AI-generated storytelling with 3D visuals, delivering an unprecedented immersive experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567920/extras/ecdc1bcad4f7dbf25e7df1ac29da3ceb.avif?t=1745576247\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567920/extras_big/ecdc1bcad4f7dbf25e7df1ac29da3ceb.avif?t=1745576247 width=800 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>The powerful AI allows you to choose any theme\u2014fantasy adventure/horror investigation/space exploration/martial arts/cats and dogs/SCP\u2014play however you want and enjoy to the fullest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567920/extras/938babf159204ad6ffd63979f6b13fea.avif?t=1745576247\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567920/extras_big/938babf159204ad6ffd63979f6b13fea.avif?t=1745576247 width=800 height=442 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This new way of gaming is just beginning to sprout and will gradually evolve. It\u2019s completely different from traditional games. Stay tuned as we continue to grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax, immerse yourself in text and role-playing, find joy, craft your own story, and become a storyteller!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come and experience it! Wishing you a great time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3567920?t=1745576247","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3567920?t=1745576247","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567920/462cb015234907cdc0f2ad772009e223473db9f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745576247","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567920/462cb015234907cdc0f2ad772009e223473db9f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745576247","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game will feature mature elements common in tabletop role-playing games, including mild horror and descriptions of criminal content."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game through your input</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the unknown and experience the infinite</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you can input anything to play the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567920/extras/938babf159204ad6ffd63979f6b13fea.avif?t=1745576247\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567920/extras_big/938babf159204ad6ffd63979f6b13fea.avif?t=1745576247 width=800 height=442 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a groundbreaking AI-driven text adventure game, it combines dynamic AI-generated storytelling with 3D visuals, delivering an unprecedented immersive experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567920/extras/ecdc1bcad4f7dbf25e7df1ac29da3ceb.avif?t=1745576247\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567920/extras_big/ecdc1bcad4f7dbf25e7df1ac29da3ceb.avif?t=1745576247 width=800 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>The powerful AI allows you to choose any theme\u2014fantasy adventure/horror investigation/space exploration/martial arts/cats and dogs/SCP\u2014play however you want and enjoy to the fullest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567920/extras/938babf159204ad6ffd63979f6b13fea.avif?t=1745576247\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567920/extras_big/938babf159204ad6ffd63979f6b13fea.avif?t=1745576247 width=800 height=442 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This new way of gaming is just beginning to sprout and will gradually evolve. It\u2019s completely different from traditional games. Stay tuned as we continue to grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax, immerse yourself in text and role-playing, find joy, craft your own story, and become a storyteller!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come and experience it! Wishing you a great time.</p>","developers":["QZQ Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567920/fb425cc9a67768d5efbfed01f0c64e59600a9810/header.jpg?t=1745576247","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><u